        <p class="rv">Security Operations Center as a Service (SOCaaS) is a managed cybersecurity service that provides continuous security monitoring and threat detection through specialized security tools and expert analysis. It helps organizations identify suspicious activities and investigate potential threats while managing security incidents across their IT infrastructure without the overhead of operating a fully in-house Security Operations Center.</p>
        <p class="rv">CipherTrivia’s SOC as a Service (SOCaaS) focuses on security log analysis and threat intelligence alongside Security Information and Event Management (SIEM) and incident response support. Our approach helps businesses gain visibility into network activity and endpoints while identifying potential security incidents and prioritizing risks based on severity. By integrating continuous monitoring with proactive threat detection, organizations can improve incident response readiness and manage evolving cyber threats across cloud environments and enterprise networks.</p>
