<section class="section section--paper" aria-labelledby="s2-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="shead">
      <div class="shead__meta"></div>
      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s2-title">Types of SOC as a Service We Provide</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">CipherTrivia offers Security Operations Center as a Service (SOCaaS) to help organizations monitor security events and identify potential cyber threats across their IT environments. Our services combine security analytics and threat intelligence with incident investigation and response support to improve threat visibility and cybersecurity operations.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="ledger ledger--10">
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("eye") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Managed SOC Services</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Our managed SOC services provide continuous security monitoring and centralized threat detection through security tools and expert analysis. This approach helps businesses identify suspicious activities and manage security risks without maintaining a fully in-house Security Operations Center.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("cloud-alert") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Cloud-Based SOC Services</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We monitor security events across cloud infrastructure and workloads hosted on AWS and Microsoft Azure. Our cloud-based SOC capabilities help identify suspicious access patterns and configuration risks while improving visibility into cloud security incidents.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("db-in") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">SIEM-Based SOC Services</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Using Security Information and Event Management (SIEM) technologies, we collect and correlate logs from applications and endpoints alongside servers and network devices. This enables our security team to investigate suspicious patterns and identify potential security incidents.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("layers") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Extended Detection and Response (XDR)</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Our XDR capabilities correlate security telemetry across supported systems to identify threats that may affect multiple environments. This approach helps connect related alerts and supports faster investigation and coordinated response activities.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("radar") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Threat Detection and Response</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Through continuous security monitoring and threat analysis, we identify suspicious activities and assess potential cyber threats. Our incident response support helps prioritize alerts and guide containment and remediation actions based on the agreed service scope.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("endpoint") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Endpoint Detection and Response (EDR)</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We monitor endpoint security events to identify malware and suspicious processes alongside unauthorized access attempts. Our EDR-focused monitoring supports threat investigation and response to help reduce the impact of endpoint-based attacks.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("network") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Network Security Monitoring</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Our network security monitoring analyzes traffic patterns and security events to identify potential intrusions and unusual connections. This helps organizations investigate network-based threats and gain better visibility into suspicious communication across their infrastructure.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("magnifier") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Threat Intelligence and Threat Hunting</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">By incorporating relevant threat intelligence and proactive investigation techniques, we help identify indicators of compromise and suspicious behavior that may not trigger conventional security alerts. These activities support early threat discovery and informed security decisions.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("gauge") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Vulnerability Monitoring and Risk Prioritization</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Our vulnerability monitoring capabilities help identify and prioritize security weaknesses based on severity and potential business impact. By correlating vulnerability information with available security events, we help teams focus remediation efforts on higher-risk assets.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("chart") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Compliance and Security Reporting</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We provide security reports covering detected threats and incident trends alongside monitoring activities and response outcomes. These insights help organizations review security performance and support alignment with relevant compliance frameworks such as ISO 27001 and SOC 2.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

